{
  "id": "E426",
  "title": "Having Dinner with a Friend",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-10-30",
  "synopsis": "What should you bring to a dinner party? This is the Beginner level winning text for our “Chinese Story” event, written by David Gladney.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50426/1cac48e406d0aa78d3c882a697068925bc0b7821.mp3?1603705457",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "跟一个朋友吃晚饭\n\n小平：小果，好久不见。我想请你来我家吃晚饭。你这个星期六有空吗？\n小果：有。我要带什么？\n小平：你不需要带任何东西。\n小果：你确定？我可以带些葡萄酒或者啤酒。\n小平：不用了。\n小果：一些水果或者蛋糕呢？\n小平：不用了。等等，我知道你能带点什么。\n小果：是什么？\n小平：带你自己！\n",
    "traditional": "跟一個朋友吃晚飯\n\n小平：小果，好久不見。我想請你來我家吃晚飯。你這個星期六有空嗎？\n小果：有。我要帶什麼？\n小平：你不需要帶任何東西。\n小果：你確定？我可以帶些葡萄酒或者啤酒。\n小平：不用了。\n小果：一些水果或者蛋糕呢？\n小平：不用了。等等，我知道你能帶點什麼。\n小果：是什麼？\n小平：帶你自己！\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Having Dinner with a Friend"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小平：小果，好久不见。我想请你来我家吃晚饭。你这个星期六有空吗？",
      "traditional": "小平：小果，好久不見。我想請你來我家吃晚飯。你這個星期六有空嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo píng xiǎo guǒ hǎo jiǔ bu jiàn wǒ xiǎng qǐng nǐ lái wǒ jiā chī wǎn fàn nǐ zhè ge xīng qī liù yǒu kòng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoping: Xiaoguo, long time no see. I want to invite you to my home to have dinner. Do you have time this Saturday?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小果：有。我要带什么？",
      "traditional": "小果：有。我要帶什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo guǒ yǒu wǒ yào dài shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoguo: Yes. What should I bring?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小平：你不需要带任何东西。",
      "traditional": "小平：你不需要帶任何東西。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo píng nǐ bù xū yào dài rèn hé dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoping: You don’t need to bring anything."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小果：你确定？我可以带些葡萄酒或者啤酒。",
      "traditional": "小果：你確定？我可以帶些葡萄酒或者啤酒。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo guǒ nǐ què dìng wǒ kě yǐ dài xiē pú tao jiǔ huò zhě pí jiǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoguo: Are you sure? I can bring some wine or beer."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小平：不用了。",
      "traditional": "小平：不用了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo píng bú yòng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoping: Don’t worry about it."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小果：一些水果或者蛋糕呢？",
      "traditional": "小果：一些水果或者蛋糕呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo guǒ yì xiē shuǐ guǒ huò zhě dàn gāo ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoguo: Some fruit or cake?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小平：不用了。等等，我知道你能带点什么。",
      "traditional": "小平：不用了。等等，我知道你能帶點什麼。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo píng bú yòng le děng děng wǒ zhī dào nǐ néng dài diǎn shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoping. Don’t worry about it. Wait, I know what you can bring."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小果：是什么？",
      "traditional": "小果：是什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo guǒ shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoguo: What is it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小平：带你自己！",
      "traditional": "小平：帶你自己！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo píng dài nǐ zì jǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiaoping: Bring yourself!"
    }
  ],
